{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}]}],"name":"docKey"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The serialized header."}]}],"name":"bytes"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"log"}]},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"serverSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientSeq","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a restore reads it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the underlying storage raises."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"metadata":{"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Yorkie8DocStoreP8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","required":true},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"title":"Yorkie","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocStore"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"title":"DocStore"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","required":true,"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"}}}